REMARK FACET backbone torsion angle prediction
REMARK https://github.com/bluegems661/facet-nmr

VARS   RESID RESNAME PHI PSI DPHI DPSI SS CHI1 CLASS
FORMAT %4d %s %8.1f %8.1f %6.1f %6.1f %s %s %s

    1 M    -64.8    -45.2   40.0   40.0 C   t Dynamic
    2 Q    -64.6    -44.9   40.0   40.0 C   t Dynamic
    3 I    -65.0    -25.2   26.0   26.0 C   t Warn
    4 F    -65.3    -35.2   26.0   26.0 H  g+ Warn
    5 V    -65.1    -34.9   16.0   16.0 H   t Strong
    6 K    -65.1    -35.2   16.0   16.0 H   t Strong
    7 T    -65.0    -35.0   16.0   16.0 H   t Strong
    8 L    -65.2    -45.1   16.0   16.0 H   t Strong
    9 T    -65.1    -35.2   16.0   16.0 H   t Strong
   10 G    -65.0    -45.1   22.0   22.0 H   . Good
